  "description": "<p>Implement and Document Side-Loading based on this design document: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1oqKZvpEBqPR9ddHbl8dMBFRUYgizvWuKVI-RBBpIyLY/edit#\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1oqKZvpEBqPR9ddHbl8dMBFRUYgizvWuKVI-RBBpIyLY/edit#</a></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>make an http POST to initiate the indexing of side-loaded OCFL ID/object.</li>\n\t<li>If the OCFL Object is not Fedora Ready an appropriate HTTP error code and explanation should be returned.</li>\n\t<li>On success,  object creation messages should be emitted.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p> </p>",
